{"id":"436508","name":"南瓜馒头","author":"英英菜谱","authorId":"6968441","desc":"","cover":"images/436508/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"750克"}],"sub":[{"name":"南瓜","amount":"一段"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"3克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/436508/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"南瓜去皮去子，入锅蒸熟。","img":"images/436508/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"酵母、白糖用温水化开倒入盆中。","img":"images/436508/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"合成软硬适中的面团，加盖放置温暖处。","img":"images/436508/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"发好的面团揉匀揪成剂子。","img":"images/436508/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"团成馒头，加盖饧20分钟。","img":"images/436508/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"冷水入锅，大火烧开后转中火蒸20分钟。","img":"images/436508/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"南瓜馒头成熟。","img":"images/436508/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}